    "menu.novedadesTit": "Today's briefing", "menu.nov1": "Dispatch asks to step up breath tests during the night.", "menu.nov2": "Fake IDs are circulating in the area: always compare the name with the system.", "menu.nov3": "Some stolen vehicles travel with registration cards from another plate.", "menu.nov4": "Remember: no helmet on a motorbike or ATV is also an offense.",
